---
<section id="proof" data-takeover="1" class="dark sec" style="padding-top: 140px; padding-bottom: 140px; background: oklch(37.9% 0.061 216.2); color: oklch(98% 0.003 197.1)">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="mono" data-fade="1" style="display: block; color: oklch(85.9% 0.018 210.2); margin-bottom: 24px">Proof</span>
<h2 data-split="1" class="disp" style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 52px; line-height: 56px; max-width: 760px">Numbers you can hold us to</h2>
<p data-fade="1" style="margin: 0 0 72px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 29px; color: oklch(85.9% 0.018 210.2)">Written into every agreement. Commitments, not targets.</p>
<p class="mega" aria-label="30 days" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(110px, 19vw, 300px); color: oklch(98% 0.003 197.1)"><span data-count="30" aria-hidden="true">30</span><span aria-hidden="true"> days.</span></p>
<p data-fade="1" class="disp" style="margin: 8px 0 88px; font-size: 30px; line-height: 38px; font-weight: 600; color: oklch(85.9% 0.018 210.2)">Notice to leave. No lock-in.</p>
<div class="proof-row">
<div data-fade="1" style="border-top: 2px solid oklch(98% 0.003 197.1 / 0.35); padding-top: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<span class="mega" style="font-size: 96px">1 day</span>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(85.9% 0.018 210.2)">New starters ready, leavers <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: oklch(98% 0.003 197.1)">locked</strong> out</p>
</div>
<div data-fade="1" style="border-top: 2px solid oklch(98% 0.003 197.1 / 0.35); padding-top: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; position: relative">
<span class="mega" style="font-size: 96px">Monthly</span>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 30px; color: oklch(85.9% 0.018 210.2)">Every backup restored and <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: oklch(98% 0.003 197.1)">tested</strong></p>
<div data-stamp="1" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; right: 0; top: -30px"><span class="stamp">TESTED</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="proof-row" style="margin-top: 72px">
<div class="ph-img-dark" data-fade="1" style="aspect-ratio: 16/10"><span class="mono" style="color: oklch(75.4% 0.026 209.3)">proof — client team at work on their own premises</span></div>
<blockquote data-fade="1" style="margin: 0; padding: 36px; background: oklch(22.1% 0.033 223.9); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px">
<p class="ph-d" style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 34px">[Client review: their own words, added once they agree to be quoted]</p>
<footer class="mono ph-d">[First name and initial, company]</footer>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</section>
